  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21463140",
      "title": "Understanding \"methods\" in Vue Apps",
      "lectureOrder": 19,
      "videoOrder": 15,
      "sourceHash": "7ed0ca054c99a8c5295d3c140a00cdbdbd5c67bb642aecff71e66c235fcca6fa",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "So with interpolation and V-bind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 8.53,
          "en": "we learned about two key features for outputting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.53,
          "end": 13.53,
          "en": "and for a using Vue-managed data in the HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.81,
          "end": 15.5,
          "en": "And that is really important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.5,
          "end": 20.11,
          "en": "Now let's make our app at least a bit more dynamic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.11,
          "end": 21.52,
          "en": "And for data, let's say we actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.52,
          "end": 23.44,
          "en": "have two possible courseGoals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.44,
          "end": 25.12,
          "en": "which we wanna output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.12,
          "end": 27.93,
          "en": "And for the moment, we'll randomly decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 29.92,
          "en": "which one to output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.92,
          "end": 31.76,
          "en": "Now for that, we need to run some code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.76,
          "end": 35.2,
          "en": "We need to basically roll a dice you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.2,
          "end": 37.44,
          "en": "and then either use this text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.44,
          "end": 39.04,
          "en": "or another text as a courseGoal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.227,
          "end": 42.44,
          "en": "And we can do this with another option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.44,
          "end": 45.87,
          "en": "We can set on this Vue app object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.87,
          "end": 48.4,
          "en": "We already set the data option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.4,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "Now it's time to learn about a new option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 54.39,
          "en": "And that's the methods option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.39,
          "end": 57.64,
          "en": "Methods allows you to define functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.64,
          "end": 60.77,
          "en": "which should execute when something happens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.77,
          "end": 64.82,
          "en": "when you call them for example, or as you will learn later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.82,
          "end": 68.14,
          "en": "when a user event like a button click occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.14,
          "end": 71.49,
          "en": "Two methods you pass a JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.49,
          "end": 73.84,
          "en": "So that's important difference to data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.84,
          "end": 77.26,
          "en": "Data itself was a function a method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.26,
          "end": 82.26,
          "en": "methods takes an object, which will be full of methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.39,
          "end": 85,
          "en": "so of functions, but these functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85,
          "end": 86.1,
          "en": "are now totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.1,
          "end": 88.07,
          "en": "You can name them however you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.07,
          "end": 93.07,
          "en": "For example, outputGoal, but this is totally up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.4,
          "end": 95.06,
          "en": "This can be any name you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.06,
          "end": 96.64,
          "en": "methods on the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.64,
          "end": 101.13,
          "en": "just like data is a reserved term, is a reserved name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 103.12,
          "en": "But inside of this methods object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.12,
          "end": 104.61,
          "en": "you can use whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.61,
          "end": 106.56,
          "en": "The only important thing here is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 106.56,
          "end": 110.99000000000001,
          "en": "that all your properties you defined in this methods object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.99000000000001,
          "end": 112.56,
          "en": "needs to be functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.56,
          "end": 115.65,
          "en": "because they need to be callable as functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.65,
          "end": 116.95,
          "en": "And you can either do it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.95,
          "end": 119.74000000000001,
          "en": "or use the method shorthand in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.74000000000001,
          "end": 121.653,
          "en": "Just as we did with data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.04,
          "end": 127.73,
          "en": "Now, in outputGoal, we could now calculate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.73,
          "end": 131.47,
          "en": "a randomNumber with math random,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.47,
          "end": 134.71,
          "en": "which is a built in function in JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.71,
          "end": 139.17000000000002,
          "en": "totally unrelated to Vue, it's a core JavaScript function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.17000000000002,
          "end": 141.41,
          "en": "And it will simply calculate a randomNumber",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.41,
          "end": 142.813,
          "en": "between zero and one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.36,
          "end": 146.66,
          "en": "And here, we could then simply add an if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.66,
          "end": 151.39,
          "en": "and say if randomNumber is smaller than zero dot five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.39,
          "end": 155.113,
          "en": "We wanna return learn Vue, as a goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.01,
          "end": 160.66,
          "en": "And else, return master Vue whatever you want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.66,
          "end": 162.253,
          "en": "those strings are up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.49,
          "end": 167.75,
          "en": "And now we got this function, this method outputGoal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.75,
          "end": 171.32999999999998,
          "en": "which will either return this or this text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.32999999999998,
          "end": 174.8,
          "en": "Now we wanna use this text here in this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.8,
          "end": 177.64,
          "en": "to well, display a different text every time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.64,
          "end": 179.3,
          "en": "this page is reloaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.3,
          "end": 182.12,
          "en": "So for that, we to call this function somehow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.12,
          "end": 183.693,
          "en": "so that it executes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 185.33,
          "end": 189.28,
          "en": "And the cool thing is we can call a method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 189.28,
          "end": 192.97,
          "en": "so a function defined in this methods object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 192.97,
          "end": 194.74,
          "en": "in our HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.74,
          "end": 199.27,
          "en": "just as we can point at a data property, you can do both.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.27,
          "end": 202.79,
          "en": "So here right now we're pointing at a data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 202.79,
          "end": 205.18,
          "en": "But we can also instead if we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 205.18,
          "end": 208.92000000000002,
          "en": "to execute a function that is defined in methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.92000000000002,
          "end": 212.28,
          "en": "that's just important, it needs to be defined and methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.28,
          "end": 215.39,
          "en": "So adding outputGoal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.39,
          "end": 218.82,
          "en": "directly in that config object you pass to create app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 218.82,
          "end": 220.913,
          "en": "would not work, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 221.79,
          "end": 224.54,
          "en": "But since outputGoal is defined in methods,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 224.54,
          "end": 225.82999999999998,
          "en": "we can call it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.82999999999998,
          "end": 228.49,
          "en": "And since we wanna call it, we need to add parentheses here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.49,
          "end": 231.13,
          "en": "just like in regular JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.13,
          "end": 233.39,
          "en": "And that's the interesting part, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 233.39,
          "end": 236.59,
          "en": "in your Vue controlled HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.59,
          "end": 238.6,
          "en": "in this interpolation syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.6,
          "end": 241.41,
          "en": "but also when using display binding syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 241.41,
          "end": 245.04,
          "en": "you can execute simple JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.04,
          "end": 247.15,
          "en": "For example, here, we could also execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 247.15,
          "end": 248.853,
          "en": "one plus one if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 249.71,
          "end": 254.71,
          "en": "We could also execute math random here, if you want a to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 255.55,
          "end": 258.81,
          "en": "What you can't do in here is write complex code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 258.81,
          "end": 262.07,
          "en": "For example, you can't use if statements in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 262.07,
          "end": 263.39,
          "en": "this will not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.39,
          "end": 265.59,
          "en": "But you can use ternary expressions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 265.59,
          "end": 268.11,
          "en": "and you can write any JavaScript expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 268.11,
          "end": 271.96,
          "en": "between your double curly braces and when using v-bind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 271.96,
          "end": 273.92,
          "en": "And therefore since we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 273.92,
          "end": 276.39,
          "en": "such basic JavaScript expressions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 276.39,
          "end": 280.313,
          "en": "we can also call outputGoal here like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 281.81,
          "end": 283.71,
          "en": "And if I save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 283.71,
          "end": 285.37,
          "en": "I see learn Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 285.37,
          "end": 288.68,
          "en": "If I reload, at some point, I'll see master Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 288.68,
          "end": 291.48,
          "en": "I'll see a different value from time to time",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.48,
          "end": 294.6,
          "en": "because we always calculate a brand new value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.6,
          "end": 296.61,
          "en": "because this gets called.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 296.61,
          "end": 299.25,
          "en": "And I'm showing this to you because it is important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 299.25,
          "end": 301.69,
          "en": "to understand how Vue works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 301.69,
          "end": 304.76,
          "en": "that you can execute JavaScript expressions here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 304.76,
          "end": 308.03,
          "en": "between the curly braces and when using v-bind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 308.03,
          "end": 310.83,
          "en": "And that this gives you a lot of flexibility.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 310.83,
          "end": 314.18,
          "en": "Because just by using this very simple example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 314.18,
          "end": 317.85,
          "en": "our application here is at least a bit more dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 317.85,
          "end": 321.26,
          "en": "because now we don't always see the same text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 321.26,
          "end": 325.46,
          "en": "Instead, after some reloads, it changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 325.46,
          "end": 327.71,
          "en": "And that is a more dynamic application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 327.71,
          "end": 330.53,
          "en": "which we can easily build with Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 330.53,
          "end": 332.15,
          "en": "and which we couldn't build",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.15,
          "end": 335.62,
          "en": "with just HTML without JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 335.62,
          "end": 338.78,
          "en": "So with that, we're already getting closer to seeing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 338.78,
          "end": 341.19,
          "en": "why Vue is really amazing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.19,
          "end": 342.79,
          "en": "and we built our first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 342.79,
          "end": 345.603,
          "en": "at least a bit more dynamic application.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
